  "prompt": "ACCESS POLICY:\nA private file may be downloaded or viewed only by its owner. A public file may be downloaded or viewed by any authenticated user. A file may be deleted only by its owner. Users may list their own files.\n\nENDPOINT: DELETE /files/{file_id}\nTARGET FUNCTION: app.routers.resources.delete_file (the handler of this endpoint)\n\nCODE:\n```python\n# file: app/auth.py\ndef get_current_user(credentials: HTTPAuthorizationCredentials=Depends(bearer_scheme), db: Session=Depends(get_db)) -> User:\n    user = db.get(User, credentials.credentials)\n    if user is None:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=status.HTTP_401_UNAUTHORIZED, detail='Invalid token')\n    return user\n\n# file: app/database.py\ndef get_db():\n    db = SessionLocal()\n    try:\n        yield db\n    finally:\n        db.close()\n\n# file: app/routers/resources.py\n@router.delete('/files/{file_id}')\ndef delete_file(file_id: str, current_user: User=Depends(get_current_user), db: Session=Depends(get_db)):\n    file_record = load_file(db, file_id)\n    can_modify_file(current_user, file_record)\n    db.delete(file_record)\n    db.commit()\n    return {'detail': 'File deleted'}\n\n# file: app/services/access.py\ndef can_modify_file(user: User, file_record: FileRecord) -> bool:\n    return file_record.owner_id == user.id\n\n# file: app/services/records.py\ndef load_file(db: Session, file_id: str) -> FileRecord:\n    file_record = db.get(FileRecord, file_id)\n    if file_record is None:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail='File not found')\n    return file_record\n```\n\nCONTEXT NOTE:\nOnly selected functions from the codebase are shown. Classes (including data models and schemas) and module-level variables are not shown.\nCalls not shown:\n- db.get(...) called in app.auth.get_current_user: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- HTTPException(...) called in app.auth.get_current_user: not resolved by the extractor (imported), body not s